{"title":"도시 황제의 귀환","thumbnail":"https://dn-img-page.kakao.com/download/resource?kid=EcK4Q/hAC1OsasWQ/xWl7nf622KXaMoND1XHhgk&filename=th3","synopsis":"힘 없고 약한 루저 장건, 아버지의 다리를 잃게한 죄책감과 여자친구마저 잃어 생을 포기하며 살아가다 무심코 밟은 텔레포트로 수련 세계로 이동했다. \n\n그곳에서 법문 인왕결로 최강 왕체를 완성해 복수하려 했지만, 마지막 관문 선문 돌파에 실패해 천벌을 받게 되어 대학 시절로 다시 돌아왔다.\n \n천벌을 받기 전 홍몽자기의 기운을 느낀 덕인지 다시 돌아온 뒤 홍몽자기로 인왕체로 만들기에 성공해 여자친구의 죽음도 막아냈다. \n\n이제 남은 건 아버지의 다리를 앗아간 그놈을 찾아가 복수하는 것! 과연 성공할 수 있을까...!","topComments":[],"commentKeywords":[],"rankSeries":{"daily":[{"date":"2026-08-12","rank":155,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-13","rank":242,"change":{"type":"down","amount":87}},{"date":"2026-08-14","rank":268,"change":{"type":"down","amount":26}},{"date":"2026-08-19","rank":122,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-20","rank":90,"change":{"type":"up","amount":32}},{"date":"2026-08-21","rank":181,"change":{"type":"down","amount":91}},{"date":"2026-08-22","rank":214,"change":{"type":"down","amount":33}},{"date":"2026-10-01","rank":154,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-10-02","rank":213,"change":{"type":"down","amount":58}},{"date":"2026-10-03","rank":216,"change":{"type":"down","amount":3}}],"weekly":[{"date":"2026-08-12","rank":262,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-13","rank":274,"change":{"type":"down","amount":11}},{"date":"2026-08-14","rank":275,"change":{"type":"down","amount":1}},{"date":"2026-08-15","rank":276,"change":{"type":"down","amount":1}},{"date":"2026-08-16","rank":274,"change":{"type":"up","amount":2}},{"date":"2026-08-17","rank":274,"change":{"type":"same","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-18","rank":272,"change":{"type":"up","amount":2}},{"date":"2026-08-19","rank":234,"change":{"type":"up","amount":38}},{"date":"2026-08-20","rank":200,"change":{"type":"up","amount":34}},{"date":"2026-08-21","rank":198,"change":{"type":"up","amount":2}},{"date":"2026-08-22","rank":187,"change":{"type":"up","amount":11}},{"date":"2026-08-23","r